Subject: [PATCH] v4: first-time fixes from the retention simulation (U050)

Onboarding keeps the sentence typed on Home and builds the first session
from it; every v4 path opens the person's own thread with a deck for their
goal; the free limit starts after the first build; the player asks for a
check-in instead of showing demo progress, offers a calendar reminder for
the next chapter, and Home leads with that chapter; Quick Start Play plays
before sign-in; Connect starts all off. v1-v3 and production unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
